  "source_code": "for i in range(int(input())):\r\n    n=int(input());a=sorted(map(int,input().split()),reverse=True)\r\n    P=[0]\r\n    for v in a:P.append(P[-1]+v)\r\n    f=lambda x,y:2*P[x]+P[x+2*y]+3*P[3*n-2*x-y]\r\n    b=0\r\n    for x in range(n+1):\r\n        l,h = 0 , n-x\r\n        while l<h:\r\n            m=(l+h)//2\r\n            if f(x,m)<=f(x,m+1):l=m+1\r\n            else: h=m\r\n        b=max(b,f(x,l))\r\n    print(b)",
